#: ../../compositing/transitions/slide.rst:15
msgid "Slide"
msgstr "Posúvanie"

#: ../../compositing/transitions/slide.rst:17
msgid ""
"The composition type **Slide** is a transition. For the duration of the "
"composition in the timeline the clips are transitioned like slides in an old-"
"fashioned slideshow."
msgstr ""
"Typ kompozície **Snímka** je prechod. Po dobu trvania kompozície na časovej "
"osi klipy prechádzajú ako snímky v staromódnej prezentácii."

#: ../../compositing/transitions/slide.rst:26
#: ../../compositing/transitions/slide.rst:45
msgid "Settings for the Slide transition"
msgstr "Nastavenia prechodu Snímka"

#: ../../compositing/transitions/slide.rst:28
msgid "Select the composition type"
msgstr "Vyberte typ kompozície"

#: ../../compositing/transitions/slide.rst:29
msgid ""
"Select the composition track. **Automatic** uses the track immediately "
"below. Only tracks with lower numbers can be selected."
msgstr ""
"Vyberte stopu kompozície. **Automaticky** používa stopu bezprostredne "
"nižšie. Vybrať možno iba stopy s nižšími číslami."

#: ../../compositing/transitions/slide.rst:30
msgid "Start position of the slide (click to select)"
msgstr "Počiatočná poloha snímky (kliknite na výber)"

#: ../../compositing/transitions/slide.rst:31
msgid "End position of the slide (click to select)"
msgstr "Koncová poloha snímky (kliknite na výber)"

#: ../../compositing/transitions/slide.rst:32
msgid "Transparency (opacity) sliders. Can be used to add a fade in or out."
msgstr ""
"Posúvače priehľadnosti (krytia). Možno ich použiť na pridanie efektu "
"stmievania alebo rozjasňovania."

#: ../../compositing/transitions/slide.rst:36
msgid ""
"The default settings are start position :guilabel:`S1` and end position :"
"guilabel:`E5`. This slides the clip in from left offscreen covering the "
"other clip in the process."
msgstr ""
"Predvolené nastavenia sú počiatočná poloha :guilabel:`S1` a koncová poloha :"
"guilabel:`E5`. Tým sa klip posunie zo ľavého okraja obrazovky a pritom "
"zakryje druhý klip."

#: ../../compositing/transitions/slide.rst:47
msgid ""
"Note the **Slide** being set up as a :doc:`Mix </compositing/transitions/"
"mixes>` to work properly sliding the second slip over the first one. If set "
"up as a :doc:`Composite Transition </compositing/transitions/"
"composite_transitions>`, the second clip overlapping the first in the track "
"below is slid over the first, tripping the whole transition."
msgstr ""
"Všimnite si, že **Snímka** je nastavená ako :doc:`Miešanie </compositing/"
"transitions/mixes>`, aby správne posúvala druhý klip cez prvý. Ak je "
"nastavená ako :doc:`Kompozitný prechod </compositing/transitions/"
"composite_transitions>`, druhý klip prekrývajúci prvý na stope nižšie sa "
"posúva cez prvý, čím naruší celý prechod."

#: ../../compositing/transitions/slide.rst:52
msgid "This list shows the reasonable combinations of start and end position:"
msgstr ""
"Tento zoznam zobrazuje rozumné kombinácie počiatočnej a koncovej polohy:"

#: ../../compositing/transitions/slide.rst:59
msgid "Start-End"
msgstr "Začiatok-Koniec"

#: ../../compositing/transitions/slide.rst:60
msgid "Example"
msgstr "Príklad"

#: ../../compositing/transitions/slide.rst:61
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "Poznámky"

#: ../../compositing/transitions/slide.rst:62
msgid "S1-E5"
msgstr "S1-E5"

#: ../../compositing/transitions/slide.rst:64
msgid "Slides from left offscreen to center. Default setting."
msgstr "Posúva sa z ľavého okraja obrazovky do stredu. Predvolené nastavenie."

#: ../../compositing/transitions/slide.rst:65
msgid "S1-E3"
msgstr "S1-E3"

#: ../../compositing/transitions/slide.rst:67
msgid "Slides from left offscreen to right offscreen. S3-E1 is the reverse."
msgstr ""
"Posúva sa z ľavého okraja mimo obrazovku na pravý okraj mimo obrazovku. S3-"
"E1 je opačný smer."

#: ../../compositing/transitions/slide.rst:68
msgid "S1-E2"
msgstr "S1-E2"

#: ../../compositing/transitions/slide.rst:70
msgid ""
"Slides from left offscreen diagonally up offscreen. S2-E1 is the reverse."
msgstr ""
"Posúva sa z ľavého okraja mimo obrazovku uhlopriečne nahor mimo obrazovku. "
"S2-E1 je opačný smer."

#: ../../compositing/transitions/slide.rst:71
msgid "S1-E4"
msgstr "S1-E4"

#: ../../compositing/transitions/slide.rst:73
msgid ""
"Slides from left offscreen diagonally down offscreen. S4-E1 is the reverse."
msgstr ""
"Posúva sa z ľavého okraja mimo obrazovku uhlopriečne nadol mimo obrazovku. "
"S4-E1 je opačný smer."

#: ../../compositing/transitions/slide.rst:74
msgid "S5-E3"
msgstr "S5-E3"

#: ../../compositing/transitions/slide.rst:76
msgid "Same as S1-E5 but flips the clips"
msgstr "Rovnaké ako S1-E5, ale prevracia klipy"

#: ../../compositing/transitions/slide.rst:77
msgid "S2-E5"
msgstr "S2-E5"

#: ../../compositing/transitions/slide.rst:79
msgid "Slides from top offscreen down to center. S5-E2 is the reverse."
msgstr "Posúva sa zhora mimo obrazovku nadol do stredu. S5-E2 je opačný smer."

#: ../../compositing/transitions/slide.rst:80
msgid "S2-E4"
msgstr "S2-E4"

#: ../../compositing/transitions/slide.rst:82
msgid ""
"Slides from top offscreen down to bottom offscreen. S4-E2 is the reverse."
msgstr ""
"Posúva sa zhora mimo obrazovku nadol na spodný okraj mimo obrazovku. S4-E2 "
"je opačný smer."
